          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="h5">Hands-Free Design</div>
        <!-- <p class="gps-product-feature-description">Effortlessly pump single or double with sleek, integrated silicone cups, motor, and user-friendly display and controls. Pump discreetly anywhere, anytime.</p> -->
